{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aLeap Tactics\u300b</strong><br>A pixel-art platform puzzle game where <strong>all mechanisms are controlled by your jumps</strong>. Combine jumping actions with interactive mechanics to cleverly unravel the path to the goal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Mechanics</strong><br>Your character has a <strong>unique activation zone</strong>. If this zone overlaps with a mechanism <i>while jumping</i>, the mechanism's state will toggle.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/b8297f175a815a9de54ced83578e7c05.poster.avif?t=1772030844\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/b8297f175a815a9de54ced83578e7c05.webm?t=1772030844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/b8297f175a815a9de54ced83578e7c05.mp4?t=1772030844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mechanism Examples</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks that appear/disappear after jumps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/3a8b89aadb52ed432441b308c03a3f82.poster.avif?t=1772030844\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/3a8b89aadb52ed432441b308c03a3f82.webm?t=1772030844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/3a8b89aadb52ed432441b308c03a3f82.mp4?t=1772030844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claws that switch between ascending/descending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/1dc44f0a14b0293f5524a7a5151859f1.poster.avif?t=1772030844\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/1dc44f0a14b0293f5524a7a5151859f1.webm?t=1772030844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/1dc44f0a14b0293f5524a7a5151859f1.mp4?t=1772030844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spiked blocks rotating clockwise post-jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/ce423ee74803af6203827be4dde86f39.poster.avif?t=1772030844\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/ce423ee74803af6203827be4dde86f39.webm?t=1772030844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ladders extending/retracting with jumps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/8e70bba26e003ebe2b853cb8b7ea3567.poster.avif?t=1772030844\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/8e70bba26e003ebe2b853cb8b7ea3567.webm?t=1772030844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/8e70bba26e003ebe2b853cb8b7ea3567.mp4?t=1772030844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A companion that jumps in sync with you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/850e9a3e0ff70dfebee0c2a48286a327.poster.avif?t=1772030844\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/850e9a3e0ff70dfebee0c2a48286a327.webm?t=1772030844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/850e9a3e0ff70dfebee0c2a48286a327.mp4?t=1772030844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Worried about platforming difficulty?</strong><br>Fear not! The game minimizes precise platforming demands. With an undo function, you can undo any jump instantly, focusing purely on puzzle-solving. Accessible even to platforming novices.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/981669b0fe81a5ace8e6bff7e5a5f959.poster.avif?t=1772030844\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/981669b0fe81a5ace8e6bff7e5a5f959.webm?t=1772030844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/981669b0fe81a5ace8e6bff7e5a5f959.mp4?t=1772030844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ jump-activated mechanisms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ handcrafted levels with a gentle difficulty curve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden challenge levels (with hints) for hardcore players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easter egg stages scattered in the game world</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549150?t=1772030844","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549150?t=1772030844","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/7c8020b1441f52b19280e2e10e00a24940f53c21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772030844","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/7c8020b1441f52b19280e2e10e00a24940f53c21/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772030844","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3683720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aLeap Tactics\u300b</strong><br>A pixel-art platform puzzle game where <strong>all mechanisms are controlled by your jumps</strong>. Combine jumping actions with interactive mechanics to cleverly unravel the path to the goal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Mechanics</strong><br>Your character has a <strong>unique activation zone</strong>. If this zone overlaps with a mechanism <i>while jumping</i>, the mechanism's state will toggle.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/b8297f175a815a9de54ced83578e7c05.poster.avif?t=1772030844\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/b8297f175a815a9de54ced83578e7c05.webm?t=1772030844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/b8297f175a815a9de54ced83578e7c05.mp4?t=1772030844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 cl